# EC-012: Copper depletion changes what additional electrolysis charge can produce
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CuSO4 0.00005mol
add v1 Na2SO4 0.001mol
seal v1 100mL
electrolyse v1 0.05A 100s
inspect v1
electrolyse v1 0.05A 300s
inspect v1
inspect
